From 64ca9f5306e8f32968eff5e7bba3610927e8966a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:36:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: add OnePlus 8 Pro telephoto
 autofocus

Add the LC898217XC voice coil driver as posted to linux-media (v4) and the
telephoto autofocus actuator in the OnePlus 8 Pro device tree. Enable
CONFIG_VIDEO_LC898217XC.

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 ...ia-i2c-Add-driver-for-LC898217XC-VCM.patch | 349 ++++++++++++++++++
